<p>Once the vehicle is positioned, the focus shifts to immobilization. Professional <strong>automobile transport</strong> operations utilize <strong>individual steel wheel-lock chocks</strong> to physically prevent tire rotation. These heavy-duty chocks are engineered to absorb lateral forces generated by highway acceleration and braking.</p>
