<p>This technique effectively neutralizes movement during highway transit, ensuring that the vehicle remains a static load relative to the <strong>vehicle transport truck</strong>. The combination of hydraulic loading, wheel chocking, and ratchet lashing creates a multi-layered safety net that is essential for modern <strong>car relocation services</strong>.</p>
